<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Douce Grâce — Espace Admin</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --beige:#f0e8dc; --beige-light:#f8f3ed; --beige-mid:#e4d5c1; --beige-dark:#c9b49a;
  --navy:#1e2d4a; --navy-mid:#2e4268; --navy-light:#4a6490;
  --text:#3a3028; --text-light:#7a6e65; --white:#fff;
  --green:#2e7d52; --red:#c0392b; --amber:#b8860b; --teal:#2e7d6b; --indigo:#3f51b5;
  --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(30,45,74,.12);
  --radius:16px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;background:var(--beige-light);color:var(--text);min-height:100vh}
.hidden{display:none!important}
button{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}
input,select,textarea{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif}

/* ══ ÉCRAN DE CONNEXION ══ */
#login-screen{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:2000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--beige-light),var(--beige-mid));
  padding:20px;
}
.login-card{
  width:100%;max-width:420px;background:var(--white);border-radius:24px;padding:44px 40px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--beige-mid);
  animation:rise .5s ease;
}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.login-brand{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:34px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px}
.login-sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--text-light);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:28px;text-transform:uppercase}
.login-lock{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px}
.form-group{margin-bottom:16px;text-align:left}
.form-group label{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:6px}
.form-group input,.form-group select,.form-group textarea{
  width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border:1.5px solid var(--beige-mid);border-radius:10px;
  font-size:14px;color:var(--text);background:var(--beige-light);outline:none;transition:border .2s;
}
.form-group input:focus,.form-group select:focus,.form-group textarea:focus{border-color:var(--navy-light)}
.login-error{color:var(--red);font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;min-height:18px}
.login-hint{margin-top:18px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.6}

/* ══ BOUTONS ══ */
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:50px;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;border:none;
  transition:all .25s;justify-content:center}
.btn-primary{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(30,45,74,.25)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--navy-mid);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--navy);border:1.5px solid var(--navy)}
.btn-outline:hover{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.btn-soft{background:var(--beige-mid);color:var(--navy)}
.btn-soft:hover{background:var(--beige-dark)}
.btn-danger{background:#fbecec;color:var(--red);border:1px solid #f0c9c4}
.btn-danger:hover{background:var(--red);color:#fff}
.btn-success{background:var(--green);color:#fff}
.btn-success:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}
.btn-sm{padding:8px 14px;font-size:10px}
.btn-block{width:100%}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}

/* ══ LAYOUT APP ══ */
#app{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
.sidebar{
  width:250px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;flex-shrink:0;padding:28px 18px;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;overflow-y:auto;
}
.sidebar-brand{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:26px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:4px;color:#fff}
.sidebar-sub{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--beige-dark);text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px}
.nav-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:4px;
  color:#cfd8ea;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;
  cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;border:none;background:transparent;width:100%;text-align:left;
}
.nav-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff}
.nav-item.active{background:var(--beige);color:var(--navy);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.nav-item .ico{font-size:17px;width:22px;text-align:center}
.sidebar-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.sidebar-foot a{color:var(--beige-dark);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;transition:.2s}
.sidebar-foot a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff}

.main{flex:1;padding:32px 40px;min-width:0}
.page-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.page-title{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:36px;color:var(--navy);line-height:1}
.page-sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--text-light);font-size:15px;margin-top:4px}
.head-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* ══ STATS ══ */
.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:18px;margin-bottom:32px}
.stat-card{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--beige-mid);transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.stat-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.stat-ico{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:10px}
.stat-num{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);line-height:1}
.stat-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-light);margin-top:6px}
.stat-card.accent{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.stat-card.accent .stat-num{color:#fff}
.stat-card.accent .stat-label{color:var(--beige-dark)}

/* ══ CARTES GRID ══ */
.toolbar{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.search-wrap{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:220px;max-width:340px}
.search-wrap input{width:100%;padding:11px 18px 11px 40px;border-radius:50px;border:1.5px solid var(--beige-mid);background:#fff;font-size:13px;outline:none;transition:border .2s}
.search-wrap input:focus{border-color:var(--navy-light)}
.search-wrap::before{content:"🔍";position:absolute;left:14px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:13px}
.chip{padding:9px 16px;border-radius:50px;border:1.5px solid var(--beige-mid);background:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-light);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--beige-dark)}
.chip.active{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-color:var(--navy)}
.cards-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{
  background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--beige-mid);
  transition:all .3s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-color:var(--beige-dark)}
.card-img{height:180px;background:var(--beige);position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}
.card-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.card-img .emoji-ph{font-size:46px;color:var(--beige-dark)}
.card-badge{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:50px}
.card-badge.off{background:var(--red)}
.card-body{padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.card-cat{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:4px}
.card-name{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.2}
.card-desc{font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:10px;flex:1}
.card-price{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px}
.card-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}
.card-actions .btn{flex:1;font-size:10px;padding:9px 10px}
.card.off-card{opacity:.55;filter:grayscale(.8)}
.toggle-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:12px;cursor:pointer}
.switch{position:relative;width:42px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0}
.switch input{opacity:0;width:0;height:0}
.slider{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--beige-mid);border-radius:50px;transition:.25s}
.slider::before{content:"";position:absolute;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;top:3px;left:3px;transition:.25s;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.switch input:checked + .slider{background:var(--green)}
.switch input:checked + .slider::before{transform:translateX(18px)}
.empty-state{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;color:var(--text-light)}
.empty-state .e-ico{font-size:44px;margin-bottom:12px}
.empty-state p{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px}

/* ══ COMMANDES ══ */
.order-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.order-item{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--beige-mid);overflow:hidden;transition:box-shadow .25s}
.order-item:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.order-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap;cursor:pointer}
.order-ref{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);min-width:110px}
.order-meta{flex:1;min-width:160px}
.order-meta .nm{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}
.order-meta .dt{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light)}
.order-total{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);min-width:80px;text-align:right}
.badge{padding:5px 12px;border-radius:50px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff}
.b-a{background:var(--amber)} .b-t{background:var(--teal)} .b-c{background:var(--indigo)}
.b-e{background:var(--navy-light)} .b-l{background:var(--green)} .b-x{background:var(--red)}
.order-detail{display:none;border-top:1px solid var(--beige-mid);background:var(--beige-light);padding:22px}
.order-item.open .order-detail{display:block}
.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
@media(max-width:760px){.detail-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.detail-box{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--beige-mid)}
.detail-box h4{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:12px}
.detail-line{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text)}
.detail-line b{color:var(--navy)}
.articles-pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text);font-family:'Jost',sans-serif}
.order-save-row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}

/* ══ MODALS ══ */
.modal-overlay{
  display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(30,45,74,.5);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  z-index:1500;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:40px 20px;overflow-y:auto;
}
.modal-overlay.active{display:flex}
.modal{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;width:100%;max-width:560px;padding:32px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 40px 90px rgba(30,45,74,.25);animation:rise .35s ease}
.modal.lg{max-width:720px}
.modal h2{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:28px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px}
.modal-sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:22px}
.modal-close{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;background:var(--beige);border:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;font-size:15px;color:var(--text-light);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:.2s}
.modal-close:hover{background:var(--beige-mid)}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
@media(max-width:600px){.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.check-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:14px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer}
.check-row input{width:17px;height:17px;accent-color:var(--navy)}
.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.modal-actions .btn{flex:1;min-width:130px}
.photo-picker{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}
.photo-preview{width:130px;height:130px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--beige);border:2px dashed var(--beige-dark);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:30px;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0}
.photo-preview img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.photo-controls{flex:1;min-width:200px}
.photo-controls .btn{width:100%;margin-bottom:10px}
.photos-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;width:100%}
.photo-slot{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.photo-slot .photo-preview{width:100%;height:100px;font-size:22px}
.photo-slot-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}
.photo-slot-actions .btn{flex:1;padding:7px 4px;font-size:12px;justify-content:center}
.hint-inline{font-size:12px;color:#8a7f73;font-weight:400}
.card-badge.multi{left:auto;right:10px;background:#c8806a}
.hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px}

/* ══ TOAST ══ */
#toast{
  position:fixed;bottom:24px;right:24px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:14px 20px;
  border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(30,45,74,.25);font-size:13px;z-index:3000;
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);pointer-events:none;transition:all .35s;max-width:340px;
}
#toast.show{opacity:1;transform:none}
#toast.err{background:var(--red)}
#toast.ok{background:var(--green)}

/* ══ RÉGLAGES ══ */
.settings-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--beige-mid);padding:26px;max-width:520px;margin-bottom:20px}
.settings-card h3{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:24px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px}
.settings-card .desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:18px}
.info-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;font-size:13px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--beige-light)}
.info-line span{color:var(--text-light)}
.info-line b{color:var(--navy);word-break:break-all;font-weight:500}

/* ══ RESPONSIVE ══ */
/* Tablette et petit écran */
@media(max-width:900px){
  #app{flex-direction:column}
  .sidebar{width:100%;height:auto;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:600;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  .sidebar-brand{font-size:18px;margin:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap}
  .sidebar-sub{display:none}
  .nav-item{flex:0 0 auto;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:50px}
  .nav-item .ico{font-size:14px}
  .sidebar-foot{display:none}
  .main{padding:24px 18px}
  .page-title{font-size:30px}
}

/* Téléphone */
@media(max-width:640px){
  .sidebar{
    position:fixed;bottom:0;top:auto;left:0;right:0;
    padding:8px 6px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    justify-content:space-around;gap:2px;overflow-x:visible;
    box-shadow:0 -6px 24px rgba(30,45,74,.18);
    border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;
  }
  .sidebar-brand{display:none}
  .nav-item{
    flex-direction:column;gap:3px;padding:6px 2px;
    font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.5px;min-width:0;flex:1;
    text-align:center;border-radius:12px;
  }
  .nav-item .ico{font-size:18px;width:auto}
  .nav-item.active{background:var(--beige);color:var(--navy)}
  .main{padding:16px 12px 92px}
  .page-title{font-size:26px}
  .head-actions{width:100%}
  .head-actions .btn{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:12px 10px}
  .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
  .stat-card{padding:16px}
  .stat-num{font-size:28px}
  .cards-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
  .card-img{height:130px}
  .card-body{padding:12px}
  .card-name{font-size:15px}
  .card-price{font-size:18px}
  .card-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}
  .card-actions .btn{font-size:9px;padding:9px 6px}
  .toggle-row{font-size:11px}
  .switch{transform:scale(.9)}
  .toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}
  .search-wrap{max-width:100%;min-width:100%}
  .chip{padding:9px 14px;font-size:10px}
  .modal-overlay{padding:0;align-items:flex-end}
  .modal{
    width:100%;max-width:100%;
    border-radius:22px 22px 0 0;
    padding:26px 18px calc(26px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    max-height:92vh;overflow-y:auto;
  }
  .modal.lg{max-width:100%}
  .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .form-group input,.form-group select,.form-group textarea{font-size:16px;padding:12px 14px}
  .modal-actions{flex-direction:row}
  .modal-actions .btn{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:13px 8px}
  .photo-picker{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .photo-preview{width:100%;height:180px}
  .photos-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .photo-slot .photo-preview{height:150px}
  .order-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:14px}
  .order-ref{min-width:auto}
  .order-meta{flex:1 1 100%;order:3}
  .order-total{order:2}
  .detail-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .settings-card{padding:20px 16px}
  #toast{left:12px;right:12px;bottom:calc(76px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));text-align:center;border-radius:14px}
  .login-card{padding:36px 24px;border-radius:20px}
}

/* Très petit téléphone */
@media(max-width:380px){
  .cards-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}

/* ── Micro-interactions tactiles ── */
.spinner{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);border-top-color:#fff;border-radius:50%;animation:spin .7s linear infinite;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:6px}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.btn.busy{opacity:.8;pointer-events:none}
.nav-item:active,.btn:active,.chip:active{transform:scale(.96)}
.card:active{transform:scale(.99)}
.nav-item,.btn,.chip,.switch{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══════════ ÉCRAN DE CONNEXION ══════════ -->
<div id="login-screen">
  <div class="login-card">
    <div class="login-lock">🔐</div>
    <div class="login-brand">Douce Grâce</div>
    <div class="login-sub">Espace de gestion</div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Mot de passe</label>
      <input type="password" id="login-password" placeholder="••••••••" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')doLogin()">
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" id="login-btn" onclick="doLogin()">Se connecter</button>
    <div class="login-error" id="login-error"></div>
    <div class="login-hint">
      💡 Première connexion : le mot de passe par défaut est indiqué dans le fichier
      <b>GS-Admin.txt</b>. Pensez à le changer dans l'onglet « Réglages ».
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════ APPLICATION ══════════ -->
<div id="app" class="hidden">

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div>
      <div class="sidebar-brand">Douce Grâce</div>
      <div class="sidebar-sub">Espace admin</div>
    </div>
    <button class="nav-item active" data-view="dashboard" onclick="showView('dashboard')"><span class="ico">📊</span> Tableau de bord</button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-view="produits" onclick="showView('produits')"><span class="ico">🧵</span> Créations</button>
